plot the courses of this pursuit. ref: $PURSUIT_ROUTE/0.wish.md

decompose the aim into courses: one subject each, in the order they build on each other.
the courses seeded in the wish are a start, not the plot; add, split, merge, or reorder them.

for each course, state:
- slug (kebab, e.g. `idempotency`)
- the subject, in one line
- what it builds on (the slug of an earlier course, or `—`)
- why this order

emit into $PURSUIT_ROUTE/1.courses.plot.yield.md, with this table first:

| k | course | subject | builds on |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | idempotency | writes that converge under retry | — |
| 2 | retries | when and how to retry a call | idempotency |
